# Ashling, Rimebound's {B}{B} is "only to cast spells with mana value 4 or greater" (CR 106.6, 202.3). With it and the
# untapped Mountain and Mox Ruby, Wheel of Fortune (mana value 3) can't be cast: the two lands' mana alone is too little and
# the black mana may not pay for it. Damnation (mana value 4) is cast with the same mana - the two black from the pool, the
# two generic from the Mountain and the Mox - and destroys Ashling with the rest.

